    {
      "number": "993",
      "text": "993．约分：\na) $\\frac{a-3}{a^2-9}$；\nb) $\\frac{x+4}{x^2-16}$；\nc) $\\frac{25-c^2}{2c-10}$；\nd) $\\frac{x^2-64}{3x-24}$；\ne) $\\frac{a^2-7a}{49-a^2}$；\nf) $\\frac{x^3-4x}{10-5x}$；\ng) $\\frac{5x^2-35x}{49-x^2}$；\nh) $\\frac{x^3+2x^2y}{4y^2-x^2}$．",
